{"1530850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Little Age", "steam_appid": 1530850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Little Age</strong> is a cozy little city builder where you start with a single hamlet, reveal the world as your civilization expands, establish new settlements, and grow them into a connected network of towns and cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is match based, and each playthrough offers a couple of hours of laid back interactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EACH SETTLEMENT HAS ITS OWN LITTLE ECONOMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have three resources to worry about: Food, Materials, and Gold. Each settlement has its own production and local economy. Hire delivery guys to move resources between settlements, boost new towns, and support places that have to grow in less-than-ideal conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/extras/70bfebb559771a5751d527ead5d2e754.avif?t=1787991085\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW UNIQUE MAP EVERY TIME YOU PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you play the world is unique. Biomes and resources create new challenges and problems to solve, and not every settlement will have an ideal environment. Some settlements will depend on the trade network to function properly. A Little Age uses a detailed procedural world generation system to create a new world every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/extras/a2ed420b228dc9de14de5b9289f4963b.avif?t=1787991085\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL SETTLEMENTS WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your civilization grows, you will choose new advancements and build a great temple to celebrate your new homeland. Your settlements can support each other, pool their resources, and grow into a healthier civilization through collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/extras/b41765d3a10fbd4f6d393d8071549333.avif?t=1787991085\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Little Age</strong> is a cozy little city builder where you start with a single hamlet, reveal the world as your civilization expands, establish new settlements, and grow them into a connected network of towns and cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is match based, and each playthrough offers a couple of hours of laid back interactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EACH SETTLEMENT HAS ITS OWN LITTLE ECONOMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have three resources to worry about: Food, Materials, and Gold. Each settlement has its own production and local economy. Hire delivery guys to move resources between settlements, boost new towns, and support places that have to grow in less-than-ideal conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/extras/70bfebb559771a5751d527ead5d2e754.avif?t=1787991085\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW UNIQUE MAP EVERY TIME YOU PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you play the world is unique. Biomes and resources create new challenges and problems to solve, and not every settlement will have an ideal environment. Some settlements will depend on the trade network to function properly. A Little Age uses a detailed procedural world generation system to create a new world every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/extras/a2ed420b228dc9de14de5b9289f4963b.avif?t=1787991085\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL SETTLEMENTS WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your civilization grows, you will choose new advancements and build a great temple to celebrate your new homeland. Your settlements can support each other, pool their resources, and grow into a healthier civilization through collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/extras/b41765d3a10fbd4f6d393d8071549333.avif?t=1787991085\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A cozy minimalist city builder about expanding a network of settlements, each with its own little economy. Manage the flow of resources between them at your own pace, and pause at any time. Watch a civilization emerge as your settlements work together to raise a great temple and claim the land.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/8636dcdf379c8f198cea8cecb05c8bd2339db4fb/header.jpg?t=1787991085", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/f2e5418f40605d5b40b56a0a57571fc51a140227/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787991085", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530850/f2e5418f40605d5b40b56a0a57571fc51a140227/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787991085", "website": "https://benerot.com/alittleage/index.html", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 1.4 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GT 720 (o